| V0_2 raw distance | 2.1120 | 0.4455 | — |
| V0_4 raw distance | -4.5758 | 1.9576 | — |
| fast-ssim2 score | 62.55 | 5.03 | 63.10 ± 4.65 |
| butteraugli 3-norm | 1.6993 | 0.2274 | 1.699 ± 0.229 |

